+# LocalWhisper v0.2.5 Master PC remote transcription
+
+This component is the default transcription backend for LocalWhisper v0.2.5.
+
+## Architecture
+
+- S25 uploads the imported voice-note file directly across the private Tailscale tailnet.
+- Endpoint: `http://master-pc-1.tail46be8b.ts.net:8766/v1/transcribe`.
+- Transport is plain HTTP **inside Tailscale's encrypted WireGuard tunnel**; the port is not exposed to the public Internet.
+- MASTER-PC binds the service only to its Tailscale address.
+- Windows Firewall restricts TCP 8766 to the S25 Tailscale address.
+- The Android app automatically falls back to its on-device whisper.cpp engine if MASTER-PC cannot be reached.
+
+## MASTER-PC inference
+
+- GPU: NVIDIA RTX 2060
+- Engine: faster-whisper / CTranslate2 CUDA
+- Default model: Large v3 Turbo
+- Default compute type: int8_float16
+- Fast profile uses beam size 1.
+- Quality model is preloaded in the background when the server starts.
+- `quality` maps to `large-v3-turbo`; `fast` maps to `base`.
+
+The deployed machine uses CUDA/cuDNN DLLs already present on MASTER-PC. The production launcher is registered as the Windows scheduled task `LocalWhisper Master PC Transcriber`.
+
+## API
+
+`GET /health`
+
+`POST /v1/transcribe` multipart fields:
+
+- `file`
+- `language`: auto/ar/en
+- `output`: original/english/both
+- `timestamps`: true/false
+- `performance`: fast/balanced/accurate
+- `model_id`: quality/fast
+
+The response records the actual engine/model and server processing time.
